  "summary": {
    "derivative_id": "der:rc4:cb_6c11b73558144c61b51d004ca5e5bef9:summary",
    "text": "5D Clinics Foundation Ltd is a Western Australia\u2013based foundation that aims to provide access to cancer treatment for everyone. It describes two core activities: consulting with clinical experts to identify treatment options tailored to individual patients, and providing financial assistance to help patients access those treatments. The foundation states a mission to move patients beyond fear of the unknown and closer to confidence when diagnosed with cancer. Stated beneficiaries are people diagnosed with cancer (patients)."
  },
